(188: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%23%20Summary%0A%0AFixes%20%238.%0A%0AThis%20PR%20turns%20mixed-region%20detection%20into%20embedded%20grammar%20parsing%20for%20supported%20targets%20while%20keeping%20the%20result%20in%20one%20links%20network.%0A%0A%23%23%20Implementation%0A%0A-%20Adds%20tree-sitter%20grammars%20for%20Rust%2C%20HTML%2C%20and%20CSS%20alongside%20the%20existing%20programming-language%20grammars.%0A-%20Parses%20detected%20embedded%20regions%20under%20their%20%60Region%60%20link%20so%20embedded%20syntax%20is%20connected%20to%20the%20host%20network%20by%20the%20shared%20byte%20range.%0A-%20Keeps%20reconstruction%20byte-exact%20when%20host%20and%20embedded%20token%20links%20overlap%20by%20reconstructing%20each%20source%20byte%20range%20once.%0A-%20Handles%20CSS%20style-attribute%20declaration%20lists%20such%20as%20%60color%3A%20blue%60%20by%20parsing%20with%20a%20synthetic%20trailing%20semicolon%20while%20clamping%20inserted%20spans%20to%20the%20original%20region.%0A-%20Adds%20a%20minor%20changelog%20fragment%20and%20an%20experiment%20script%20for%20inspecting%20the%20HTML%20mixed-mode%20fixture.%0A%0A%23%23%20Reproduction%20%2F%20Tests%0A%0AThe%20reproducing%20gap%20was%20that%20mixed-region%20tests%20only%20asserted%20detected%20%60Region%60%20metadata.%20%60embedded_regions_are_parsed_and_connected_to_region_links%60%20now%20fails%20unless%20Markdown%20fenced%20JavaScript%2C%20Markdown%20HTML%2C%20HTML%20%60%3Cscript%3E%60%2C%20HTML%20%60%3Cstyle%3E%60%2C%20and%20style%20attributes%20produce%20grammar-backed%20syntax%20links%20rooted%20at%20their%20region%20links%20while%20still%20reconstructing%20the%20host%20document%20exactly.%20%60content_driven_embedded_regions_are_parsed%60%20covers%20untagged%20content-driven%20fenced-code%20detection.%0A%0ALocal%20verification%20passed%3A%0A%0A-%20%60cargo%20fmt%20--all%20--%20--check%60%0A-%20%60cargo%20clippy%20--all-targets%20--all-features%60%0A-%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-no-src-tests.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-file-size.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-crate-size.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-changelog-fragment.rs%60%0A-%20%60git%20diff%20--check%60%0A%0A%23%23%20Notes%0A%0AThis%20is%20not%20a%20UI%20change%2C%20so%20screenshots%20are%20not%20included.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
