(246: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: Fixes%20%239.%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Summary%0A-%20Adds%20a%20natural-language%20annotation%20layer%20over%20existing%20lossless%20text%20parses%20for%20the%2010%20natural-language%20targets.%0A-%20Emits%20region-scoped%20Language%2C%20Semantic%2C%20and%20word%20Token%20links%20without%20changing%20stored%20source%20bytes.%0A-%20Adds%20detector%20configuration%20with%20Lingua%20as%20the%20default%20backend%20and%20Whatlang%20as%20the%20alternative.%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Implementation%0A-%20Uses%20%60lingua%60%20for%20default%20language%20identification%2C%20%60whatlang%60%20when%20configured%2C%20%60unicode-segmentation%60%20for%20non-CJK%20word%20segmentation%2C%20and%20%60lindera%60%20Jieba%20segmentation%20for%20Mandarin.%0A-%20Annotates%20NFC%2FNFD%20normalization%20stability%20and%20bidi%20direction%20as%20Semantic%20links%20over%20the%20existing%20source%20span.%0A-%20Adds%20the%20NLP%20dependencies%20with%20required%20language%20features%20plus%20a%20minor%20changelog%20fragment.%0A-%20Initializes%20the%20Windows%20MSVC%20environment%2C%20configures%20AWS-LC%20CMake%20settings%2C%20and%20pins%20Cargo%27s%20Windows%20MSVC%20linker%20to%20Visual%20Studio%20%60link.exe%60%20so%20Git%20for%20Windows%20%60link.exe%60%20cannot%20shadow%20it%20during%20the%20transitive%20Lindera%20Jieba%20build.%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Reproduction%20Tests%0A-%20%60natural_language_parse_adds_segmentation_language_and_unicode_annotations%60%20covers%20Latin%20segmentation%2C%20Mandarin%20%60%E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD%E3%80%82%60%20segmentation%2C%20and%20Arabic%20bidi%2Fnormalization%20annotations.%0A-%20%60natural_language_identifier_backend_is_switchable%60%20verifies%20the%20configurable%20Whatlang%20detector%20path.%0A-%20%60natural_language_fixtures_keep_byte_exact_reconstruction_with_language_regions%60%20verifies%20all%2010%20natural-language%20fixtures%20reconstruct%20byte-for-byte%20and%20get%20region-scoped%20Language%20links.%0A-%20%60windows_test_job_configures_aws_lc_cmake_before_running_tests%60%20guards%20the%20Windows%20workflow%20setup%20needed%20by%20the%20new%20Lindera%20dependency%20chain%2C%20including%20the%20explicit%20Cargo%20MSVC%20linker%20path.%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Local%20Verification%0A-%20%60cargo%20fmt%20--all%20--%20--check%60%0A-%20%60cargo%20clippy%20--all-targets%20--all-features%60%0A-%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-no-src-tests.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-file-size.rs%60%20%28passes%3B%20warns%20%60tests%2Funit%2Flink_network.rs%60%20is%20near%20the%20line-count%20threshold%29%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-crate-size.rs%60%0A-%20%60git%20diff%20--check%60%0A%0A%23%23%23%20CI%20Verification%0A-%20%60CI%2FCD%20Pipeline%60%20run%20%6027076870156%60%20passed%20for%20commit%20%608ee657816642ea04e4fde7bcceb4be17b551e969%60.%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
