(465: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: Fixes%20%2312%0A%0A%23%23%20Summary%0A-%20Added%20grammar-backed%20%60Delphi%2FObject%20Pascal%60%20parsing%20through%20%60tree-sitter-pascal%60%200.10.2%2C%20with%20aliases%20for%20%60Delphi%60%2C%20%60Object%20Pascal%60%2C%20and%20%60Pascal%60.%0A-%20Replaced%20the%20minimal%20Pascal%20fixture%20with%20a%20Delphi-style%20unit%20that%20exercises%20a%20generic%20class%2C%20RTTI-style%20attribute%2C%20and%20property%20while%20preserving%20byte-exact%20reconstruction.%0A-%20Documented%20the%20selected%20grammar%2C%20MIT%20license%20compatibility%2C%20accepted%20generic-Pascal%20baseline%20decision%2C%20and%20remaining%20limits%20versus%20full%20Delphi%20compiler%20coverage.%0A-%20Added%20a%20minor%20changelog%20fragment%20and%20removed%20the%20initial%20placeholder%20%60.gitkeep%60%20scaffold%20file.%0A%0A%23%23%20Reproduction%20And%20Verification%0ABefore%20this%20branch%2C%20adding%20%60Delphi%2FObject%20Pascal%60%20to%20the%20grammar-backed%20fixture%20coverage%20failed%20because%20the%20adapter%20fell%20back%20to%20plain%20lossless%20token%20parsing%20and%20emitted%20no%20tree-sitter%20syntax%20links.%20The%20updated%20fixture%20coverage%20reproduces%20that%20gap%20by%20requiring%20byte-exact%20reconstruction%2C%20a%20clean%20verification%20report%2C%20and%20Pascal%20grammar%20syntax%20nodes.%0A%0AAutomated%20tests%20added%20or%20extended%3A%0A-%20%60tests%2Funit%2Fgrammar_parsing.rs%3A%3Agrammar_backed_programming_fixtures_emit_syntax_links_and_round_trip%60%0A-%20%60tests%2Funit%2Fgrammar_parsing.rs%3A%3Adelphi_object_pascal_fixture_uses_tree_sitter_pascal%60%0A-%20%60tests%2Funit%2Fgrammar_parsing.rs%3A%3Apascal_aliases_use_tree_sitter_pascal%60%0A%0ALocal%20checks%20run%3A%0A-%20%60cargo%20fmt%20--check%60%0A-%20%60cargo%20clippy%20--all-targets%20--all-features%60%0A-%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-no-src-tests.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-file-size.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-crate-size.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-changelog-fragment.rs%60%0A-%20%60git%20diff%20--check%60%0A%0AScreenshots%20are%20not%20applicable%3B%20this%20is%20parser%2Fbackend%20behavior.%0A%0A%23%23%20Provenance%0ASelected%20%60tree-sitter-pascal%60%200.10.2%20from%20crates.io%20because%20it%20is%20MIT%20licensed%2C%20exposes%20the%20same%20safe%20%60LANGUAGE%60%20binding%20API%20used%20by%20the%20existing%20tree-sitter%20grammar%20crates%2C%20and%20advertises%20Pascal%20dialect%20coverage%20for%20Delphi%20and%20Free%20Pascal%20constructs.%20The%20project%20accepts%20this%20published%20grammar%20as%20the%20initial%20baseline%20rather%20than%20forking%3B%20version-specific%20Delphi%20and%20Free%20Pascal%20mode%20differences%2C%20conditional%20compilation%20variants%2C%20package%2Flibrary%20projects%2C%20design-time%20artifacts%2C%20and%20semantic%20compiler%20checks%20remain%20outside%20advertised%20grammar-backed%20scope%20until%20dedicated%20fixtures%20are%20added.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
