(625: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: Fixes%20%2315%0A%0A%23%23%20Summary%0A-%20Add%20a%20public%20%60find%28%29%60%20%2F%20%60replace%28%29%60%20transform%20surface%20over%20%60LinkNetwork%60%2C%20backed%20by%20the%20existing%20S-expression%20query%20matcher%20and%20capture%20results.%0A-%20Add%20%60ReplacementRule%3A%3Acaptured_text%60%20for%20codemod-style%20source%20edits%20that%20rewrite%20only%20captured%20token%20ranges%20while%20preserving%20every%20untouched%20byte.%0A-%20Add%20structural%20%60ReplacementRule%60%20variants%20that%20delegate%20to%20the%20existing%20substitution%20APIs.%0A-%20Add%20README%20usage%20docs%20and%20a%20minor%20changelog%20fragment%3B%20remove%20the%20temporary%20PR%20scaffold%20%60.gitkeep%60.%0A%0A%23%23%20Reproduction%20And%20Verification%0ABefore%20this%20branch%2C%20callers%20had%20separate%20query%20and%20substitution%20primitives%20but%20no%20single%20ergonomic%20surface%20for%20selecting%20captures%2C%20applying%20a%20replacement%2C%20and%20asserting%20Recast%2Fjscodeshift-style%20unchanged-byte%20preservation.%0A%0AAutomated%20fixtures%20added%3A%0A-%20%60query_transform%3A%3Ajscodeshift_style_identifier_fixture_renames_only_captured_identifiers%60%20selects%20JavaScript%20%60identifier%60%20captures%2C%20renames%20only%20the%20two%20intended%20occurrences%2C%20preserves%20a%20comment%20containing%20the%20same%20text%2C%20and%20verifies%20the%20output%20is%20exactly%20the%20original%20source%20with%20only%20reported%20ranges%20replaced.%0A-%20%60query_transform%3A%3Arecast_style_literal_fixture_changes_only_the_literal_bytes%60%20changes%20a%20JavaScript%20numeric%20literal%20while%20preserving%20surrounding%20formatting%20and%20comments.%0A-%20%60query_transform%3A%3Areplace_can_delegate_structural_rules_to_apply_substitution%60%20verifies%20the%20new%20%60replace%28%29%60%20wrapper%20can%20route%20structural%20rules%20through%20%60apply_substitution%60.%0A%0A%23%23%20Local%20Checks%0A-%20%60cargo%20fmt%20--check%60%0A-%20%60cargo%20clippy%20--all-targets%20--all-features%60%0A-%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-no-src-tests.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-file-size.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-crate-size.rs%60%0A-%20%60rust-script%20scripts%2Fcheck-changelog-fragment.rs%60%0A%0AScreenshots%20are%20not%20applicable%3B%20this%20is%20backend%2FAPI%20behavior.%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
